{"seq":2,"slug":"fracture-graph","title":"断裂连接图","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-destruction-systems/fracture/fracture-graph","wordCount":1896,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"断裂连接图\">断裂连接图</h1><p>一堵墙被 Voronoi 切成了四十块，但玩家看到的仍是一堵完整的墙——因为这四十块彼此「粘」在一起，且整体钉在地基上。让碎块知道自己和谁相连、谁支撑着谁、哪些块钉死在世界上，靠的就是断裂连接图（connection graph / fracture graph）。这张图是判断「哪部分会坍塌」的唯一依据，也是应力传播的运行舞台。本篇专讲这张图怎么建、怎么维护，应力如何在图上流动则留给下一篇。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><strong>断裂连接图</strong>（connection graph / fracture graph）是一张无向带权图 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>V</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G=(V,E)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>：节点是碎块，边表示两碎块间的连接，边权 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_{ij}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是连接强度；其中被标记为钉死在世界、永不脱落的特殊节点子集称为<strong>锚点</strong>（anchor）。它的核心作用是把结构力学问题简化为图论问题——一个碎块「有没有支撑」的判据就是<strong>它是否通过一条尚未断裂的边路径连接到至少一个锚点</strong>。围绕这张图还有两个关键概念：<strong>连通分量</strong>决定哪一簇碎块作为整体运动；<strong>成簇</strong>（clustering）把仍连通且相对静止的一组碎块合并为单个刚体，使未受损部分零额外开销。边的断裂由应力传播驱动，删边后从锚点重算连通分量即判定坍塌。</p>\n<h2 id=\"图的结构-节点-边-锚点\">图的结构：节点、边、锚点</h2><p>断裂连接图是一张无向带权图 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>V</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G = (V, E)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。节点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span> 是<a href=\"voronoi-fracture\">Voronoi 碎裂</a>产出的每一个碎块；边 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span> 是两个相邻碎块之间的连接，边权 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_{ij}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 表示这条连接的强度（能承受多大力才断）。此外有一个特殊的节点子集——<strong>锚点</strong>（anchor / kinematic chunk），它们被标记为钉死在世界坐标、不受重力、永不脱落，代表地基、承重结构或与其它物体固连的部分。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>元素</th>\n<th>数据</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>节点 chunk</td>\n<td>碎块几何、质量、当前损伤</td>\n<td>物理与损伤的载体</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>边 connection</td>\n<td>连接的两碎块 ID、连接面积、强度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_{ij}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>传力路径、断裂判定单元</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>锚点 anchor</td>\n<td>布尔标记</td>\n<td>支撑判定的根</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>连通分量</td>\n<td>图的动态划分</td>\n<td>决定哪一簇作为整体运动</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一个碎块「有没有支撑」的判据非常简洁：<strong>它是否通过一条尚未断裂的边路径连接到至少一个锚点</strong>。这条判据把复杂的结构力学问题简化成了图连通性问题——这是破坏系统能实时跑坍塌的根本原因。这条规则在<a href=\"../foundations/destruction-model\">破坏模型</a>里已埋下伏笔，这里给出精确形式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"连接如何建立\">连接如何建立</h2><p>连接图的边在离线烘焙碎块后立即构建。判定两碎块是否相邻，有两类常用准则：</p>\n<p><strong>几何邻接</strong>：两碎块共享一个 Voronoi 切面（即它们的站点在 Voronoi 图中互为邻居）。这是最自然的判据，切面面积直接作为连接强度的基准——切面越大，连接越结实。</p>\n<p><strong>距离邻接</strong>：两碎块的碰撞形状在一定容差内接触或重叠。当碎块几何不是严格来自同一次 Voronoi（比如混合了不同来源的碎块）时用它兜底。</p>\n<p>连接强度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_{ij}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 通常取切面面积 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_{ij}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与材料抗拉强度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span> 的乘积：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>σ</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_{ij} = \\sigma \\cdot A_{ij}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这意味着大接触面的连接（如墙体主体之间）很难拉断，而细颈处（如装饰性突出部）一碰就掉，符合直觉。锚点则在烘焙时按规则标记：与地面接触的碎块、或美术手动指定的承重块。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[碎块集合] --&gt; B[对每对相邻碎块&lt;br/&gt;判定邻接]&#10;  B --&gt; C{共享切面&lt;br/&gt;或接触?}&#10;  C --&gt;|是| D[建连接边&lt;br/&gt;权 = 面积 x 强度]&#10;  C --&gt;|否| E[无连接]&#10;  D --&gt; F[标记锚点碎块&lt;br/&gt;接地/承重]&#10;  F --&gt; G[完成连接图]&#10;  G --&gt; H[运行时: 边可被断裂事件删除]\">flowchart TD\n  A[碎块集合] --&gt; B[对每对相邻碎块&lt;br/&gt;判定邻接]\n  B --&gt; C{共享切面&lt;br/&gt;或接触?}\n  C --&gt;|是| D[建连接边&lt;br/&gt;权 = 面积 x 强度]\n  C --&gt;|否| E[无连接]\n  D --&gt; F[标记锚点碎块&lt;br/&gt;接地/承重]\n  F --&gt; G[完成连接图]\n  G --&gt; H[运行时: 边可被断裂事件删除]</pre><h2 id=\"连通性与坍塌判定\">连通性与坍塌判定</h2><p>运行时，<a href=\"stress-propagation\">应力传播</a>会不断删除超过强度的边。每当有边被删，图的连通结构就可能改变，需要重新判断哪些碎块还连着锚点。做法是从所有锚点出发做一次图遍历（BFS/DFS 或并查集），标记所有可达碎块为「有支撑」；遍历不到的碎块则<strong>失去支撑</strong>，立即从静态结构中释放，成为独立动态刚体，交给物理模拟。</p>\n<p>这个「删边→重算连通分量→释放失支撑块」的循环，就是结构坍塌在数据层的全部本质。用并查集（Union-Find）维护连通性可以让增量更新接近常数摊还复杂度，但删边不利于并查集（并查集擅长合并不擅长拆分），因此实践中常在一帧内批量收集所有断裂边、然后重跑一次从锚点出发的遍历，而不是逐边增量。遍历范围也可局部化：只有被删边波及的连通分量需要重算，未受影响的分量跳过。</p>\n<h2 id=\"成簇-把整块运动的碎块合一\">成簇：把整块运动的碎块合一</h2><p>如果每个碎块永远是独立刚体，那么一堵没被打的墙也要维护四十个刚体，白白浪费。连接图的另一大作用是<strong>成簇</strong>（clustering）：把仍然连通、且相对静止的一组碎块合并成一个刚体簇（cluster），物理引擎只把它当<strong>一个</strong>刚体来模拟。只有当簇内有边断裂、连通性改变时，才把簇拆开成更小的簇或独立碎块。</p>\n<p>成簇让「未受损部分零额外开销」成为可能：完好的墙就是一个大簇（等价于一个静态刚体），受击后局部才裂成小簇。这套簇的动态合并与拆分，正是<a href=\"../simulation/joint-constraints\">约束与连接</a>一篇要用物理约束去实现的机制，也是<a href=\"../simulation/debris-physics\">碎块物理</a>里 island 分组的上层依据。连接图与成簇的关系可以这样理解：连接图是「谁连着谁」的静态拓扑，簇是「当前哪些连通块作为整体运动」的动态划分。</p>\n<h2 id=\"图的健壮性陷阱\">图的健壮性陷阱</h2><p>连接图看似简单，实际藏着几个必须防的坑。其一是<strong>悬浮碎块</strong>：烘焙时若邻接判定容差太严，某些本应相连的碎块没建上边，运行时它会莫名其妙悬在空中不掉、或一开始就掉——需要在烘焙后做一次连通性校验，警告没连到任何锚点的孤立块。其二是<strong>过度连接</strong>：容差太松会把不该相连的碎块也连上，导致该塌的不塌。其三是<strong>图规模</strong>：碎块数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 决定图的节点数，边数在密集碎裂下可达 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 到数倍，遍历开销随之增长，这又回到<a href=\"voronoi-fracture\">Voronoi 碎裂</a>里「碎块总数是核心旋钮」的结论。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>断裂连接图是带权无向图：节点是碎块，边是连接（权=切面积×强度），锚点是钉死在世界的支撑根。</li>\n<li>「有无支撑」被简化为「是否有未断路径连到锚点」的图连通性问题，这是实时坍塌的根本简化。</li>\n<li>连接在烘焙时按共享切面或接触建立，运行时应力传播删边，靠从锚点遍历重算连通分量来判定坍塌。</li>\n<li>成簇把连通且静止的碎块合并成单个刚体，让未受损部分零额外开销，是性能的关键。</li>\n<li>需防悬浮碎块（漏连）、过度连接（错连）与图规模爆炸三类陷阱。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>力如何在这张图上流动：<a href=\"stress-propagation\">应力传播</a></li>\n<li>碎块来源：<a href=\"voronoi-fracture\">Voronoi 碎裂</a>；成簇的物理实现：<a href=\"../simulation/joint-constraints\">约束与连接</a></li>\n<li>跨库：从锚点遍历本质是图搜索，见 <a href=\"../../pathfinding-navigation-mesh/foundations/a-star-algorithm\">寻路导航 · A* 算法</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"断裂连接图","id":"断裂连接图"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"图的结构：节点、边、锚点","id":"图的结构-节点-边-锚点"},{"level":2,"text":"连接如何建立","id":"连接如何建立"},{"level":2,"text":"连通性与坍塌判定","id":"连通性与坍塌判定"},{"level":2,"text":"成簇：把整块运动的碎块合一","id":"成簇-把整块运动的碎块合一"},{"level":2,"text":"图的健壮性陷阱","id":"图的健壮性陷阱"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"Voronoi 碎裂","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-destruction-systems/fracture/voronoi-fracture"},"next":{"title":"应力传播","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-destruction-systems/fracture/stress-propagation"}}